{"segs": ["PA_ja_40:0.2", "PA_ja_40:0.3"], "en": "The Collection of Single Verses, Chapter on the Bird’s Nest (Kulāvakavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_40:0.4"], "en": "10. The Khadiraṅgāra Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_40:1.1", "PA_ja_40:1.2"], "en": "“Even if I must fall into hell, with my feet upward and my head downward;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_40:1.3"], "en": "\"I shall not act unrighteously;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_40:1.4"], "en": "come now, accept this alms-food.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_40:2.1"], "en": "The *Khadiraṅgāra Jātaka*, the tenth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_40:2.2"], "en": "The fourth chapter, the Kulāvaka Chapter.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_40:3.1"], "en": "Its summary verse (uddāna) is:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_40:4.1"], "en": "Sirī, Mātali, Dhītara, and Pakkhivara.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_40:4.2", "PA_ja_40:4.3"], "en": "Ratiyāgata, Mātāpitaro, and again Jagatīruha, Vuḍḍha, Sukakkaṭaka,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_40:4.4"], "en": "and likewise Nandaka with Piṇḍavara— these are the ten.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
